# Direct test dependencies, pinned to the versions the suite is verified against.
#
# Lower bounds alone let CI test whatever was newest that day: mcp 2.x renamed the API the
# MCP server uses, and SQLAlchemy 2.1 switched the default PostgreSQL driver to psycopg 3,
# each breaking CI with no change to the code. Upgrade deliberately: bump a pin, run the
# suite, commit both together.
#
# Service modules are imported directly, so their runtime libraries are needed too, minus
# the GPU stack (imported lazily).

